  "prefLabel": "Ch 302.01 Granting of Initial License",
  "priorExpiration": "1999-05-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 302.01 Granting of Initial License. The board shall grant an initial license to practice chiropractic to any applicant who complies with the application process specified by Ch 302.02, meets the qualifications set forth in Ch 303, and has paid the license fee specified by Ch 306.01.\n\nSource. #1488, eff 11-20-79; ss by #2052, eff 6-9-82; ss by #2716, eff 5-17-84; ss by #4671, eff 9-7-89; ss by #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #8187, eff 10-8-04; ss by #10432, eff 10-5-13; ss by #12431, eff 12-8-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ch100-500.html"
